  "visualBrief": "Temple of Peace present-day visible ruins: seven mapped re-erected plain pink granite shafts on white stepped bases/stylobate, roofless low brick/concrete court traces, fallen drums and fragments, patchy paving in the exposed western court, and eight low mapped eastern relics. The intervening native terrain is preserved. Keep the independent Santi Cosma e Damiano church, later structures, Basilica of Maxentius, Nerva and neighboring Roman Forum. No intact Roman roof, entablature or lost superstructure is reconstructed.",
